title: digidollar-oracle-tools
abstract: >-
  Operator tools and monitoring scripts for DigiByte DigiDollar oracle nodes:
  a health monitor with Discord and email alerting, a shared network-status
  bot for the community Gitter channel, and VPS and home-network hardening
  guides. Runs on Linux, Windows, and macOS.
